  "problem": "the 'fact' text is an entire outcome/decisions field (170-273 chars, numbered ①②③), while the target text is a *summary*. The control facts come from adjacent days of the same projects, so control and target share genre and vocabulary almost exactly. Measured symptom: ctrl_week 0.687 > sim_week 0.632 — a control that resembles the window more than the fact does cannot be a baseline.",
